  "description": "The moment she parted ways with her beloved family, Haru the cat returned to her childhood days before she was adopted. She sets out on a journey toward the house of her memories to reunite with her mother, Sowon, who does not yet know her, but for a small cat who does not understand human language or the way, the world is too vast and dangerous. Will Haru be able to become a family again?\nSource: MU",
